[gd_scene load_steps=11 format=3]

; Prototype Zero — Gate D: the one Graveblade.
;
; The registered KayKit Skeleton Warrior carrying the registered Skeleton Blade.
; This scene owns pursuit, the attack-permission request, a committed and
; readable attack, Life, deterministic Physical damage, and mechanical death.
; It has no XP award, no loot, and no wave logic: those are Gates E and F.
;
; Capsule: 0.80 m diameter (P) x 1.80 m tall — the same body the player has, so
; reach and awareness distances mean one thing across the encounter.
;
; Physics layers: the body is on layer 4 ("enemy") and masks world + player, so
; it blocks and is blocked but never enters the navigation bake. Its TargetArea
; is on layer 3 ("target"), which is where Quick Strike's cursor pick,
; soft-target cone, and release query look.
;
; The retimed attack clip is attached HERE rather than inside
; graveblade_rig.tscn, so the Gate A rig scenes and the preserved Gate A spike
; stay byte-for-byte unchanged.

